{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d3e189b2830c3f9059766e7327aa06b4c4c483990b7484ce50a29e1e92a6a6ae","ja":"いつも通りに！","zh":"像平常那样！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"87c80442d94fcf9413cf9456435edc37f425af5d49a8706a1b91dfdb78dd74a1","ja":"でも、よく考えたら、兄ちゃんたちに\nライブ観られるのって、今さらだよなぁ。","zh":"不过仔细想想，让哥哥他们\n来看演唱会，事到如今也没什么好在意的啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e4815054ff4b1b6a3663001fef8b92e14fa3e46884845ca2ef8cd8fe076bb672","ja":"家族参観ライブになったからって、\nやることが変わるわけじゃないし。","zh":"就算变成了家庭公开演出，\n要做的事情也不会有什么改变嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"37ba5766d44a69f20a1ca70efab0405ec6c819e7f6d4ef54126e1f0a4ab38b0c","ja":"たしかにそうですね。\n……不意打ちのおかげで、ちょっと動揺したぞ。","zh":"确实如此呢。\n……多亏这突如其来的一出，让我有点慌了神啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8eb59733d6d36c5b60bd2a3e9bb4b0c14d4a028f0dd4cef16bba8e67f9e535c3","ja":"私たちはいつも通り、みなさんに\n楽しんでもらえるライブをお届けするだけです。","zh":"我们只要像往常一样，为大家\n带来能乐在其中的演出就好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5278bd49c80fbf28c01d8c765298fc41a6721a692b85859cbd5b683c3d95cb6c","ja":"ああ！　せっかくのゲリラライブだし、\nいっぱい驚かせて、思いっきり盛り上げようぜ！","zh":"好啊！既然是难得的突击演出，\n就好好吓大家一跳，彻底把气氛炒热起来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"df93772c56238d41b4235945e6612beeef0d4a364d79312e5fccacff85e9f84a","ja":"そ、そうだよね……！\nいつも通りに……いつも、通り……。","zh":"对、对啊……！\n和平常一样……和平、常一样……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"544f92af2018c676e4cca833fe81fbc464baf1d269834ec6d433e4d653b7cada","ja":"うぅ……せっかくお母さんが見にきてくれたのに、\n失敗しちゃったらどうしよう……！？","zh":"呜……妈妈难得来看我一次，\n要是搞砸了该怎么办啊……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"85b161bfd9abe99258ce5018549909977916c1e861dbbe2467a9245917418154","ja":"ええっ！？　いやいや、大丈夫やって！　ほ、ほら！\n今までもたくさんの人の前で、歌ってきたやん？","zh":"哎哎！？不不不，没事的啦！你看你看！\n至今为止不也在那么多人面前唱过歌吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5ec3c16dc7f0938601f313ef221a39ef16dbe280321368df23bdce5b214ea2e5","ja":"ここは、アイドルとして立派な姿を見せられる\nチャンスと考えましょう。ポジティブに。","zh":"就当这里是展现偶像帅气一面的\n好机会吧。积极一点。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"8e20e804ef97538d7dc3ea0d0c3d953359b75aeb58bef665c63dbd74ccbc2d83","ja":"そうそう！　絶対に楽しんでくれるお客さんがいるって\n思えばいいんだよ！　それなら逆に心強いだろ？","zh":"没错没错！只要想着一定会\n有乐在其中的观众，不就行了吗！这样反而很令人心安吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"46a76a2d4b27c329c09f6c7d4d6d1da3833aa3664cf5632f2a5495b7b83a954a","ja":"う、うん……。奈緒ちゃん、昴ちゃん、瑞希ちゃん。\nあ、ありがとう……！","zh":"嗯、嗯……奈绪、昴、瑞希。\n谢、谢谢你们……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"18412a14f4bdac74e610db71b6ee152d8ee09b279d4c72b5df6b48d0cf8e4f4a","ja":"お、ええ表情になってきたやん♪\nライブ、みんなで楽しもな！","zh":"哦，表情变得挺不错了嘛♪\n演出，大家要一起好好享受哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1604.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"9dd716b4353d5c8d2d22a8d7b6e9a6c2786186222839b471f64c98d2c11341ae","ja":"うん……！\n私、頑張るね……！","zh":"嗯……！\n我会加油的……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
